---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
import ClientCopy from '../components/ClientCopy.astro';
import PageQuestions from '../components/PageQuestions.astro';
import ImageCredit from '../components/ImageCredit.astro';
import client from '../data/client-content.json';
const questions=[['How does the recruitment process begin?','Start by sharing the role, number of vacancies, location, required experience, compensation and expected joining date. The team reviews the requirement and clarifies the criteria before sourcing.'],['Who decides which candidate is selected?','The employer reviews shortlisted profiles and makes the hiring decision. Adhuni supports agreed sourcing, screening, communication and coordination activities.'],['Is the same process used for every requirement?','The stages provide a common framework, while the scope, assessments, interview steps and timetable are agreed around the particular role or workforce requirement.']];
---
<Base title="Our Recruitment Approach & Process | Adhuni HR Solutions" description="Explore Adhuni’s eight-stage recruitment process, from understanding the requirement and sourcing candidates to selection, joining and follow-through." image="/images/planning.webp" breadcrumbs={[{name:'Our Approach',href:'/our-approach/'}]}>
<PageHero eyebrow="Our Approach" title="A clear process. A shared understanding." description="Recruitment starts with the actual requirement behind a vacancy. We bring the role, candidate criteria and next steps into one coordinated conversation." image="planning.webp" alt="Professionals reviewing a workforce plan and recruitment requirements" cta={{label:'Discuss your requirement',href:'/employers/#requirement'}}/>
<section class="section"><div class="container page-editorial"><div><div class="eyebrow">REQUIREMENT-DRIVEN RECRUITMENT</div><h2>Understand the work before the search.</h2></div><div class="page-prose"><p class="lead">Our recruitment approach combines targeted candidate sourcing, screening, shortlisting and recruitment coordination to help employers build dependable teams.</p><p>Rather than treating recruitment as a simple CV-matching exercise, we aim to understand the actual requirement behind every vacancy and identify candidates who are relevant to it.</p><p>The role, qualifications, experience, location, compensation, vacancy volume and joining requirements shape the selection plan. Responsibilities and service scope are agreed before the process moves forward.</p></div></div></section>
<section id="process" class="section surface"><div class="container"><div class="eyebrow">OUR RECRUITMENT PROCESS</div><ClientCopy text={client.Services['Our recruitment process']}/></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="container page-two-col"><div><div class="eyebrow">A USEFUL FIRST BRIEF</div><h2>What we need from you.</h2><p class="section-intro">The more clearly the requirement is defined, the more accurately we can source.</p><ul class="page-role-list">{['Company / organisation name','Job title and number of vacancies','Qualifications and experience','Mandatory certifications or licences','Work location and expected joining date','Salary / compensation and benefits'].map((point,index)=><li><span aria-hidden="true">0{index+1}</span><strong>{point}</strong></li>)}</ul></div><aside class="page-brief"><div class="eyebrow">CLEAR RESPONSIBILITIES</div><h2>Know the next step.</h2><p>Agree who reviews profiles, who conducts interviews and who provides feedback. Confirm the employer’s selection criteria and the responsibilities for documentation and joining.</p><p>Timelines depend on the actual requirement, candidate availability and selection decisions. Discuss urgency early so the plan reflects the work involved.</p><div class="client-actions"><a href="/employers/#requirement" class="button navy">Submit Your Requirement →</a><a href="/candidates/#how-it-works" class="text-link">See the candidate journey →</a></div></aside></div></section>
<section class="section surface"><div class="container faq-wrap"><div><div class="eyebrow">QUESTIONS &amp; ANSWERS</div><h2>Clarity at every stage.</h2></div><PageQuestions questions={questions}/></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="container"><div class="page-end-cta"><div><h2>Find the service that fits.</h2><p>Explore the seven recruitment services or tell us what your business needs.</p></div><a class="button navy" href="/services/">Explore our services →</a></div><ImageCredit image="planning.webp"/></div></section>
</Base>
